    product of the two omega^2 roots = 4*Omega**2*c2*k**2*cos(theta)**2;   shearing sheet (axisymmetric): det = -I*omega*(4*Omega**2 - 2*Omega*S + c2*k**2 - omega**2); = i omega (omega^2 - kappa^2 - c2 k^2): True
